OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother very warm or hot day.
OL,6,FMainly dry and bright with some sunny
OL,7,Fspells, though the sunshine turning
OL,8,Fhazy at times. Small chance of the odd
OL,9,Fafternoon shower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe odd shower possible at
OL,12,Ffirst, otherwise dry with sunny then
OL,13,Fclear spells in the evening. Cloud and
OL,14,Fshowery rain spreads east overnight,
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FCloudy with some showers at
OL,18,Ffirst, soon clearing in the morning.
OL,19,FThen dry with bright spells in the
OL,20,Feast, cloudier in the west with the
OL,21,Fodd shower. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
